                    "text": "Below is the image you'll be seeing to show you where you're at and what the next step is throughout the study. To start, you will go through the instructions then complete a quick quiz to ensure your understanding of them.",
                    "image": {
                        "alt": "Signpost image",
                        "src": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RUCALC/beliefans/master/img/road_map_1.jpg"
                    },
                    "title": "Road Map"
                }
            ],
            "showPreviousButton": true
